        },
        "quote": "(a) Discontinued Operations. A registrant who has determined to discontinue its operations in the City must either:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "489d51f1-22d7-50c0-993f-e9a28df3d24e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 312,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:1",
          "start": 116
        },
        "quote": "(1) Provide information satisfactory to the Director that the registrant’s obligations for its equipment in the right-of-way under this chapter have been lawfully assumed by another registrant; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "27d58839-519b-59e3-8d03-d2686a36f0f0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 496,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:2",
          "start": 313
        },
        "quote": "(2) Submit to the Director a proposal and instruments for transferring ownership of its equipment to the City. If a registrant proceeds under this clause, the City may, at its option:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "656f4115-4df7-54b0-8763-b1db448f5edc",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 527,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:3",
          "start": 497
        },
        "quote": "(i) Purchase the equipment; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "8fb54eb9-7569-565a-87f3-ac0d7e254b5a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 593,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:4",
          "start": 528
        },
        "quote": "(ii) Require the registrant, at its own expense, to remove it; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "f02d2289-5b90-500e-832d-e05c9e5820d6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 758,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:5",
          "start": 594
        },
        "quote": "(iii) Require the registrant to post a bond in an amount sufficient to reimburse the City for reasonably anticipated costs to be incurred in removing the equipment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "9065ebda-5bf2-5ada-8c9f-d248aec848f1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1244,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:6",
          "start": 759
        },
        "quote": "(b) Abandoned Equipment. Equipment of a registrant who fails to comply with the above and which for two years remains unused shall be deemed to be abandoned. Abandoned equipment is deemed to be a hindrance. The City may exercise any remedies or rights it has at law or in equity, including but not limited to: (1) abating the hindrance, (2) taking possession of the equipment and restoring it to a usable condition, or (3) requiring removal of the equipment by the original registrant.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.30.280 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "df14a178-bb8c-5930-b7bd-047d796c2b52",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1510,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:7",
          "start": 1245
        },
        "quote": "(c) Removal. In the central business district (defined in TMC 3.40.010 ) registrants who have unusable and abandoned equipment in any right-of-way may be required to remove it during the next scheduled excavation. (Ord. 17587 § 5-24, 10-24-00. Code 1995 § 130-699.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.280:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
